
config GABS_TEST
    bool "Enable gabs API conformance tests (ztest backend)"
    select ZTEST
    select CPP
    select REQUIRES_FULL_LIBCPP
    help
      Enables every Kconfig option required to build gabs' platform-
      agnostic API conformance tests against the ztest backend: the
      ztest framework itself, C++ support, and a full C++ standard
      library (needed for the placement new GABS_SUITE_F relies on).

      The C++ standard itself (CONFIG_STD_CPP17) is a choice symbol and
      can't be forced by select here, so the application must still pick
      it in its own prj.conf.
